{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Brew potions, build bonds, and discover magic in a cozy new world.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ve always longed for something more. When a strange dream pulls you forward, you find yourself wondering if any of it could be real. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to Ravenrift</strong>, a charming town where witches and other magical creatures live side by side. Craft custom brews, run your own potion shop, and fall in love with a mysterious town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913650/extras/0d15392db2bf863b380452b691df3014.poster.avif?t=1754372549\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913650/extras/0d15392db2bf863b380452b691df3014.webm?t=1754372549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913650/extras/0d15392db2bf863b380452b691df3014.mp4?t=1754372549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913650/extras/8d791297094612c0908fb3266e60ed9d.avif?t=1754372549\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913650/extras/732aca79abfcf757587f4b8b52ba1977.avif?t=1754372549\" /></div>Craft a variety of potions by mixing up foraged ingredients. Sell them to the townspeople from the store attached to your home.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913650/extras/d5b5b83f5681b0ef7caac077f15e5ea3.avif?t=1754372549\" /></div>Explore new zones to forage for magical plants and other materials to use in your crafting and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913650/extras/f4fa4867356f62cc8d0dc44c44c74fec.avif?t=1754372549\" /></div>Meet the residents of Ravenrift. Uncover their stories and personalities with meaningful interactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913650/extras/6b09ba5ea9de51e0cbbf150450290ecb.avif?t=1754372549\" /></div>Unlock and wield elemental magic in combat against creatures that roam the areas outside of the town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913650/extras/28ca7019b8e96ccdd90c3a8a50a254bc.avif?t=1754372549\" /></div>Dive into an enchanted new world filled with hand-drawn pixel graphics. Discover if it's really all a dream and try to build a life in this strange new place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913650/extras/3d0be743b505d3c780bf1ed6a45219b0.poster.avif?t=1754372549\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913650/extras/3d0be743b505d3c780bf1ed6a45219b0.webm?t=1754372549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913650/extras/3d0be743b505d3c780bf1ed6a45219b0.mp4?t=1754372549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground